WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.667
This tanker reached Malta

2
00:00:01.667 --> 00:00:03.067
with a warship lashed

3
00:00:03.067 --> 00:00:04.067
to each side.

4
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:06.667
It was August
nineteen forty-two.

5
00:00:06.667 --> 00:00:08.200
Malta was under siege,

6
00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:10.367
and desperately
short of fuel.

7
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:13.500
Ohio was carrying
thousands of tons.

8
00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:15.100
A torpedo struck.

9
00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:16.600
Bomb attacks followed.

10
00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:18.067
Her engines failed,

11
00:00:18.067 --> 00:00:19.633
and water flooded in.

12
00:00:19.933 --> 00:00:21.900
Towing her was a struggle:

13
00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:24.233
the damaged ship kept
swinging off course.

14
00:00:24.533 --> 00:00:26.533
So destroyers
came alongside,

15
00:00:26.533 --> 00:00:28.600
securing the tanker
between them,

16
00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:31.033
while other vessels
helped with the tow.

17
00:00:31.433 --> 00:00:33.100
On August fifteenth,

18
00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:35.100
Ohio entered
Grand Harbour.

19
00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:37.367
Her fuel was unloaded,

20
00:00:37.367 --> 00:00:39.867
helping Malta’s aircraft
keep fighting.

21
00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:41.900
The precious part
of this wreck

22
00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:43.367
was still inside her.
